    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered list of every validation and side-effect applied when creating an owner via `POST /api/owners`. The endpoint is `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner(...)` (`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:104-145`), taking a `@Valid @RequestBody OwnerFieldsDto`.\n\n## Phase 0 \u2014 Before the controller runs\n\n1. **Idempotency filter** (`IdempotentCreateFilter`, an `OncePerRequestFilter`) \u2014 runs before Spring MVC. If the request carries an `Idempotency-Key` header seen before, it *replays the stored response and short-circuits the entire flow*. Otherwise it lets the request through and will cache the response afterward (side-effect: stores the response body/status if 2xx).\n2. **Authorization** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` role check (active only when `petclinic.security.enable=true`).\n\n## Phase 1 \u2014 Bean Validation of `OwnerFieldsDto` (fails \u2192 400 via `ExceptionControllerAdvice`)\n\nApplied in field-declaration order:\n\n3. **Class-level `@ValidPostcode`** \u2014 cross-field: if postcode present and city maps to a known region, enforces NSW 2000\u20132099 / VIC 3000\u20133099 / QLD 4000\u20134099.\n4. **firstName** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern`, `@Size(1..30)`\n5. **lastName** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern`, `@Size(1..30)`\n6. **address** \u2014 `@Pattern(non-blank)`, `@Size(1..255)` (nullable)\n7. **addressLine1** \u2014 `@Pattern(non-blank)`, `@Size(1..255)` (nullable)\n8. **addressLine2** \u2014 `@Pattern(non-blank)`, `@Size(1..255)` (nullable)\n9. **city** \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern(non-blank)`, `@Size(1..80)`\n10. **telephone** \u2014 custom `@E164NationalLength` (national-digit count per country code) + `@NotNull`, `@Pattern`, `@Size(1..20)`\n11. **email** \u2014 custom `@NonDisposableEmail` (rejects mailinator/tempmail/guerrillamail) + `@Size(max 255)`, `@Email`\n12. **postcode** \u2014 `@Pattern(^\\d{4}$)` (nullable)\n13. **registrationDate** \u2014 `@PastOrPresent`\n14. **birthDate** \u2014 `@PastOrPresent`\n15. **title** \u2014 `@Size(1..10)`\n\n(`sharesHousehold` has no constraints and is never read \u2014 dead input.)\n\n## Phase 2 \u2014 Controller body (mapping + normalizing side-effects)\n\n16. **DTO \u2192 entity mapping** (`ownerMapper.toOwner`), whose setters mutate the entity:\n    - `setEmail` **lower-cases** the email\n    - `setAddress`/`setAddressLine1`/`setAddressLine2` **normalize** via `AddressNormalizer` and recompose `address`\n    - `setTelephone` **normalizes to E.164**\n17. **Registration-date adjustment** \u2014 `BusinessDay.adjust(...)` rolls the date (or `now()`) forward past weekends/holidays, then `setRegistrationDate(...)`.\n18. **Load all non-deleted owners** \u2014 `clinicService.findAllOwners()` (read).\n\n## Phase 3 \u2014 Business-rule guards (reject before save)\n\n19. **Rate limit \u2192 429** if \u2265100 existing owners share the adjusted registration date.\n20. **Duplicate/capacity \u2192 409** if any owner shares the same `identityKey` (SHA-256 of phone + email + soundex(lastName)) **or** \u226550 owners already in the same city.\n\n## Phase 4 \u2014 Derive & set entity fields (side-effects on the entity, in order)\n\n21. `setNamesakeCount(...)` \u2014 count of same first+last name.\n22. `setHouseholdMemberCount(1 + same-household count)`.\n23. `setMemberId(...)` \u2014 builds and de-duplicates a member id.\n24. `setPossibleDuplicate(...)` / `setPossibleDuplicateOf(...)` \u2014 soft-duplicate detection.\n25. `setCapacityWarning(...)` \u2014 true if \u226540 owners in same city.\n\n## Phase 5 \u2014 Persist (`saveOwner` \u2192 `repository.save`)\n\n26. **`@PrePersist defaultRegistrationDate()`** \u2014 defaults registrationDate if null (safety net).\n27. **INSERT** into DB. (Pets cascade `ALL`, but a new owner has none.)\n28. **`@PostPersist onCreate(...)`** in `OwnerAuditListener`:\n    - computes membershipLevel + ownerSegment\n    - writes an **audit log** line (`AUDIT` logger)\n    - emits a structured JSON **`OWNER_CREATED` event** (monotonic `seq`, schemaVersion 2)\n    - emits a **welcome notification** (`NOTIFY` logger)\n\n## Phase 6 \u2014 Response building (no DB writes)\n\n29. **Entity \u2192 response DTO** (`toOwnerDto`) computing derived read-only fields (membership points/level, segment, locality, timezone, etc.).\n30. **Cap `membershipLevel`** at household max + 1.\n31. **Set `bulkSignupWarning`** if >80 owners share the registration date.\n32. Set **`Location: /api/owners/{id}`** header, return **201 CREATED**.\n33. The idempotency filter **caches/stores** the response if an `Idempotency-Key` was present.\n\n**Cross-cutting:** the `CallMonitoringAspect` (`@Around` on `@Repository` beans) times/counts the repository calls for JMX during the reads and the save.\n\nNote that no password encoding or role assignment happens here \u2014 those apply to the separate `User` entity, not `Owner`."
